DexSwapModule_AddRouter
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
├── when router is zero address
│   └── it should revert with DexSwapModule_ZeroRouter
├── when router has no deployed code
│   └── it should revert with DexSwapModule_RouterNotContract
├── when router is already whitelisted
│   └── it should revert with DexSwapModule_RouterAlreadyAdded
└── when all validations pass
    ├── it should whitelist the router
    ├── it should emit RouterAdded
    └── it should allow the router in isRouterAllowed
